  "configuration_id": "config_006",
  "reason": "Evidence strongly favors scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + weighted fusion (config_042 at 0.7250 is the current best). The major untested design dimension is multiprofile vs. singleprofile: all 7 completed experiments used multiprofile with an aggregation step, so we have no data on whether the aggregation is genuinely adding signal or introducing noise. config_006 (singleprofile, scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, weighted) directly tests this question with the best-performing encoders and fusion. If singleprofile matches or exceeds 0.725, it also reduces cost (no aggregation step, estimated ~2.5 GPU hours vs. ~3.6–4.7 for multiprofile+transformer). If it underperforms, it confirms multiprofile+transformer is essential, letting the final 2 experiments focus on multiprofile refinements. This is the highest-information experiment remaining given the budget."
}

